# Sync (`src/sync/**`)

- `SessionEditorState` (`EditorState` without a view) is the document truth. One `EditorState` per view.
- Forward document `ChangeSet`s from the session to every view (star, never view-to-view).
- Do not forward selection.
- Structure actions follow `SPEC.md` § 7.3: plan → one ChangeSet → apply on the canon → forward → reproject tree → validate scopes → recompute relations → one timeline entry.
- Step 4 must be atomic across all view states — partial forwarding is a construction defect.
- `EditorView.update` is not reentrant (§ 11.1.5): while walking views, call `update` on each view, never `dispatch` (that would re-enter the origin path).
